  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845854,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Step into the high-octane world of espionage as James Bond in *007 Racing* for PlayStation! Developed by Eutechnyx and based on the iconic James Bond film franchise, this racing game puts you behind the wheel of legendary vehicles like the Aston Martin DB5, Lotus Esprit, and BMW Z8, each equipped with signature Q-Branch gadgetry and weaponry. \n\nThe game’s storyline follows Bond as he confronts a nefarious plot by a European diplomat and businessman to smuggle NATO weapons to international terrorists.  Your mission: thwart his plans and recover stolen technology, leading you on a globe-trotting adventure from New York City to Mexico and the Baltic Sea. \n\n*007 Racing* blends racing action with mission-based objectives, offering a unique gameplay experience.  While the game engine is modified from Eutechnyx’s earlier *Le Mans 24 Hours*, expect thrilling chases, gadget-filled challenges, and appearances from familiar faces like John Cleese as Q. Though the graphics may be dated, the opportunity to drive as 007 and experience a Bond-inspired narrative makes this a must-have for fans of the franchise."
    },
